    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Escape the busy daily grind and become a baby again! </h2><br>The ultimate game for recapturing the pure joy of babyhood that we've all forgotten. By simply shaking a rattle, you can unlock the infinite possibilities that lie dormant within you.<br><br><strong> Simplicity that anyone can enjoy: </strong><br>This game is something that people of all ages can quickly enjoy. Whether you are a beginner or an expert, you can experience the joy of freely shaking a rattle.<br><br><strong> Unexpected surprises and moments of smiles: </strong><br>Experience the unpredictable humor that lurks in each and every moment of daily life. Sentences are randomly generated based on the combination of &quot;when,&quot; &quot;who,&quot; and &quot;what,&quot; making you break into a smile unexpectedly.<br><br><strong> Learn again, grow again: </strong><br>By shaking the rattle, rediscover the fresh surprises and curiosity you felt as a baby. By exploring new movements and rhythms, the inner baby within you will grow once more.<br><br><strong> A beautiful world from a baby's perspective: </strong><br>Beautiful landscapes and graceful music will help you rediscover the world from a baby's perspective. By looking at the world from a new viewpoint, a peaceful feeling and a tranquil atmosphere are born.",
